  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a donabe vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced eggplant and cook until it is tender and lightly browned.",
    "Add the diced celery and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped capers and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ferment-kimchi and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked Italian rice and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the caponata hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
